      "id": "text-a43e01e1ae4613facc1e",
      "classification": "review-candidate",
      "reviewKind": "manual-triage",
      "value": "Hyper-realistic wax figure surface: characteristic waxy translucency with subsurface light diffusion giving skin an uncanny inner glow. Surface is ultra-smooth but not plastic — retains very subtle hand-sculpted tool marks at close inspection. Specular response is soft and broad, not sharp like plastic or latex. Slight color banding where pigment layers were built up — pinkish undertones visible at thin areas like nostrils and ear edges. Micro-cracks and hairline fissures in areas of thermal stress. Glass eyes with too-perfect iris detail and slightly mismatched specular highlights compared to skin. Hair insertion points visible where individual strands or clusters meet the wax scalp. Subtle dust accumulation in recessed areas. Temperature-affected surface — minor softening and fingerprint impressions near heat sources. Gravity effects: very slight droop or sag in unsupported thin areas over time.",
